#Claude Code
# Ignore .claude/* rather than .claude itself: git won't descend into an
# ignored directory, so the negation below only works if the directory stays
# visible. Everything under .claude is local-only (settings, logs) except
# more_context/, which is shared documentation referenced from CLAUDE.md.
.claude/*
!.claude/more_context/


